                  <description>A seizure type with focal onset, with awareness or impaired awareness, either motor or non-motor, progressing to bilateral tonic clonic activity. The prior term was seizure with partial onset with secondary generalization. (Source: Fisher ea 2017, Table 2; Beniczky ea 2017, Supplement 1, ILAE seizure classification code  I.D.01.)</description>
